### Functional Testing
- **Loading**: Verified the 2s initial loader appears on first load.
- **Auth Flip**: The card flips smoothly and swaps sides as requested.
- **Integration**: All forms (Login/Register) are correctly sending data to the existing API routes.

```bash
# Verification of project integrity
$ npx tsc --noEmit
